WEBVTT

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.680
Things are moving so fast.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.350
The moments ticking by.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.180
I'm running through this city.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.020
To me, a savanna.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.350
Like it's struggling...

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.350
... trying to break free...

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:32.690
... I wanna test all this power!

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.360
I know that "The Answer"...

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.700
... is out there someplace.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:40.030
The answer that everyone looks for...

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:43.540
... from the day they're born.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.200
When all looks lost...

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.710
... and there's no escape...

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.370
... I turn to my dreams!

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:53.210
I'm not afraid of getting hurt...

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:56.550
... but I'm not strong, either.

00:00:56.550 --> 00:01:00.050
It's just that I can't stand...

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:03.490
... just doing nothing anymore!

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:06.990
Here we go, go! I'll just run on...

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:10.660
... and let nobody stop me now!

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.830
I wanna find the me in the future...

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:19.000
... and give her a reason for life!

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:39.690
What's up?! What is it?!

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:42.020
A fight! A fight!

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.030
Why do you two have to be
such stubborn idiots...

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:50.540
...who won't listen to reason?!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.370
You get your way too much!

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:54.870
At least listen to our
ideas for a change!

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.880
Come on, either way
in this case is all right...

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.210
...so why not do it Lina's way?

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:02.810
No, Gourry. We're going to be
perfectly clear this time.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.980
I personally don't care
to follow Lina's ideas.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.820
Neither do I, normally...

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.490
...but I think her idea's
the right one in this case.

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:11.990
No, that's not true!

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:15.330
Miss Lina's just saying
what she wants!

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:17.660
You guys are the ones screaming
about what they want!

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:21.330
My decision is based
on prior research!

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:23.170
And I have done my own
research into this matter!

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:27.010
Yeah! The food Atlas City
is most famous for is...

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:28.500
Nyo- Heron's Roast Beef!

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.010
The Nyara-Nyara Hot Pot!

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.520
I'd go with Nyo- Heron's.

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:45.860
No, Nyara-Nyara!

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:46.860
Nyo- Heron's!

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:48.690
It has to be Nyara-Nyara!

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:56.030
I can see there's no hope
for compromise here.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.540
It looks that way.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.470
Let's go, Gourry!
We're gonna have roast beef.

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.810
Naturally, naturally.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.640
And we shall dine on hot pot.

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.810
You may go elsewhere.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:09.150
Do whatever you want!
Stay at your own inn, too!

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:12.140
Sure thing. See you two later!

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.160
Pig Head!

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:19.490
Stubborn!

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:38.810
"A Wonderful Business!
Being a Bodyguard Isn't Easy!"

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.350
Mmmm! Delicious!

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:45.350
This is great! I love it!
Too bad about Zel and Amelia.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:48.850
Those idiots are missing
a great meal here!

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.850
I agree.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.360
I can't get enough of this!
It's delicious!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.530
You appear to be a traveling
mercenary and a sorceress.

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:00.370
Would you be interested
in taking a job?

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:01.970
Who are you?

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:06.640
The bodyguard of Mr. Tarimu the director
of Atlas City's Sorcerers' Guild.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.970
You may be interested
in my proposition.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.310
After we eat.
Can you hang on a sec?

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:14.810
Hey! Gourry, I said that was mine!
Leave it alone!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:15.810
Excuse me?

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.320
Delicious!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.820
Too bad about Miss Lina
and Mr. Gourry.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:23.490
They're missing
a great meal here!

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.980
I agree.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.160
You appear to be a traveling
mercenary and a sorceress.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.670
Would you be interested
in taking a job?

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:35.830
Who are you?

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:40.670
The bodyguard of Mr. Demia the director
of Atlas City's Sorcerers' Guild.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.670
You may be interested
in my proposition.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.010
We're eating now,
so you'll have to wait.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.180
Here, Mr. Zelgadis.
It's all cooked over here.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.510
The fish over here
looks tasty as well.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:52.350
- This one does too!
- Hello? Excuse me?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.850
Well, to make a long story short...

00:04:55.850 --> 00:05:00.620
...the Guild holds its vote on
the directorship next month.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:03.960
Uh huh.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:07.630
The former director
disappeared suddenly.

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:10.800
The vote's going to be between
myself and Demia...

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:14.140
...but I don't think that crook
wants a fair election!

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:18.980
He sends assassins after me,
hiring mercenaries and vagrants.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:22.310
It's gotten to the point
where I need a bodyguard!

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:27.490
Mr. Tarimu needs a bodyguard
for self-defense.

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:30.160
Once I'm the director...

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:32.490
...I'll be glad to throw him off
the board of trustees.

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:36.150
But what if Demia
becomes the director?

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.000
Oh, that's impossible.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.830
He has a slight personality problem.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.500
Tarimu, Tarimu,
Tarimu, Tarimu!!!

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.670
You think you can be
the next director?!

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:52.510
Me! Me! It's gonna be me!

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:56.010
For the sake of the Guild...

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:59.350
...Mr. Demia must think
of a way to deal with Tarimu.

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:01.290
Damn him! Damn him!

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.280
Damn him!! Damn him!!

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.960
I don't think Tarimu is going
to stand for a fair election.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:15.630
He's hiring mercenaries to
keep me away from the election!

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:21.140
Mr. Demia needs a bodyguard
for self-defense.

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:23.980
You two! Git rid of Tarimu's mercenaries!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:28.470
Teach Tarimu a lesson for all
the damage he's done!

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.150
Man, it looks like a pretty
pointless power struggle.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:35.320
True, but it pays great!

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.990
Yeah, well, we wouldn't have
taken this job otherwise.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.160
God, I can't believe
I hired myself out...

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.830
...to shake down some mercs
over at Demia's place.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.660
I think this job
suits you perfectly.

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:44.500
What did you say?!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.170
Um... Gee, I wonder where
Zelgadis and Amelia are.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.500
Who cares?

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.160
Probably still eating their hot pot.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.010
I won't forgive this
Tarimu person!

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:58.340
Trying to influence
an election by force!

00:06:58.340 --> 00:07:00.350
I don't think we
should take all that...

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:02.950
...Demia says as the gospel truth.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.610
This is just a power struggle.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:09.450
Then why did you take this job
of fighting Tarimu's mercenaries?

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.460
Because it pays well.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:14.790
It's no concern of ours who
becomes the next director.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:16.290
I see...

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.130
By the way, I wonder what Miss Lina
and Mr. Gourry are up to.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:21.630
Who knows? I personally don't care.

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:26.800
Right. She's probably still fighting
Mr. Gourry for the roast beef.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:36.150
This is Demia's house.

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.150
Now, the question is how
do we demolish it?

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:41.820
Demolish it? What are you planning?

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:44.160
First off, a fireball into this gate...

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.320
...and Boom! Boom! Boom!
Blow it to pieces!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.160
I think doing something
that obvious...

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.500
...might get the attention
of the local authorities.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.660
Oh? So what would you do?

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:57.170
If any mercs come out here,
we can do what we want to them.

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:59.670
Are you the mercenaries
Tarimu hired?

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:02.770
You're not what I was
expecting he'd send.

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.280
No matter.

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:09.280
I, the wizard Karuas, shall dispose
of those who stand against Mr. Demia.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.780
People shouldn't make
promises they can't keep!

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:16.290
You should know your limits!
"Earth below, heed me!"

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.950
What? Hey! What's the big idea?!

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:23.630
That's really cold,
just saving yourself, Lina!

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.960
Fine! I'll take care
of things down here!

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:27.630
Oh, an attack where earth spirits
disrupt the ground...

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.970
...and turn it to mud, huh?

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:32.300
Works in theory, but,
well, too bad.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.640
Instant levitation. Not bad.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.810
Oh, you showed me some
impressive stuff, too.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:37.810
Like simultaneously levitating...

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:41.470
...and casting a spell to turn
the ground to mud.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:44.310
But it ends now!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.320
Ray Wing!

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:48.480
What the-?!

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.660
You can't cast any more
spells now, can you?!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.660
So why don't I take
you out right now?!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:57.660
Flare Arrow!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.490
What?!

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.760
No way!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.930
Surprised, little witch?!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.270
His shoulder guards
are laughing, too?!

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.790
Are you the mercenaries
Demia hired?

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.620
You're not what I was
expecting him to send.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.620
No matter.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:29.460
I shall dispose of those who
stand against Mr. Tarimu.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.620
Enough boasting! Come on!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:43.970
What?!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:53.650
This is a black magic sword
Mr. Tarimu made for me!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:56.490
I'll teach you to respect its power!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:00.480
In other words, what you did
just now wasn't your real power!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:03.990
Sh- Shut up!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.990
Come on. I'll teach you what real power is.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.680
These aren't just shoulder guards!
They're alive!

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.680
Alive? Those faces on your shoulders...

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.850
Exactly!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:25.850
They're a chimera Mr. Demia
made out of 2 brau demons.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.190
They can cast all sorts
of simple magic spells.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.360
As long as I wear this...

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:34.690
...I'm able to cast three spells
simultaneously!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.030
Well, aren't you proud of yourself.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:39.700
It still means you can personally
only cast one spell at a time!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.030
Sh- Shut up!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.030
Lighting!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:49.210
Agh! Damn! I can't see!
Where are you, witch?!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:50.200
Above me?!

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.650
Freeze...

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:06.150
Arrow!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.000
Well, I'd say that's that.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.830
What do you mean,
"that's that"?!

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.670
Oh, sorry, Gourry!
Forgot about you.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.000
Like hell!

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.690
Well, let's go back
and get our payment.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:36.350
Right. We've beaten
the bad mercenary, right?

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.860
Are you people morons?!

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:55.370
What do you mean you beat
Demia's mercenaries?!

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:58.540
He's still got some real killers
working for him!

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:04.480
A heartless magic- using swordsman
and some crazy girl...

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:07.990
We must've passed each other.
What could we do?

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.320
Who could have guessed they'd
come to this mansion?

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:15.490
I want you to teach them how
foolish it is to go against me!

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.330
You, you, you...

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:21.170
You morons!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.670
What do you mean you beat
Tarimu's mercenaries?!

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:28.330
He's still got some bloodthirsty
killers working for him!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:34.510
A smart-ass sorceress
and some-idiot swordsman...

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:37.520
I'm sorry, sir.
We didn't realize...

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.850
You'll have no complaints
if we beat them, too, right?

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.020
I don't want any of this
to reach the public!

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:46.010
I'll be happy if you just drive
Tarimu's mercenaries away!

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:48.690
What's that?

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:51.360
What the-?! Why's it so cold
all of a sudden?

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.700
It's covered with ice!

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.870
Freeze Arrow!

00:12:56.870 --> 00:13:02.470
Freeze Arrow! Freeze Arrow!
Freeze Arrow! Freeze Arrow!

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.810
Hey, we don't want anyone
to see us doing this.

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:06.300
We'd better go.

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.470
Fireball!

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:25.330
Damn him! Damn him!
It's cold...

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.320
Now they're insulting us.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:33.170
I see, I see! You sealed
Demia in ice, huh?

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:36.670
Along with his heartless magic- using
swordsman and the crazy girl.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:39.510
If there's nothing else to be done,
how about you pay us?

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.340
Right. The payment...

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.510
What's happening?! A storm?!

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:50.840
What's happening?!
Is someone controlling the wind?!

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:53.360
That should take care of them.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:55.350
Right. We'd better get out of here now.

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:04.300
They aren't sealed in any ice,
are they?!

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:07.310
Damn it! Now I'm pissed!
Let's go, Gourry!

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:09.470
This time you can think
of something to try on them!

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:11.480
Sure! Leave this to me!

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:13.640
I see! I see! I see!

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:15.980
I really fixed you this time, Tarimu!

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:18.310
All right, now for your payment...

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.310
Wh- What was that?!

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.660
I'll admit, this'll work fine...

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.990
...but couldn't you think of
an easier way to do it?

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:29.330
I'm not a sorcerer.
I have to use my muscles!

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:30.990
Let's do it! Here goes!

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:33.650
Okay, now run for it!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.670
How could they?!

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:37.670
Fresh garbage?

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:41.330
This stinks! This really stinks!
You didn't punish them at all!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:44.510
I won't forgive them!
For playing this dirty...

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:47.180
...they shall be smashed
with the Hammer of Justice!

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:52.170
I see. So, now Demia is...
Now what?!

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:01.790
Why, you... You didn't
punish them at all!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:05.630
I'm starting to regret I ever
hired you people!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.300
It's okay. I think this is...

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.300
...a lot better than what happened
to Demia's mansion.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.460
What do you mean "okay"?!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.970
What do you mean "okay"?!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:17.310
I'm saying it shows that
his bodyguards are useless.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:22.300
I didn't hire you to show
if they were useful or not!

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:28.150
I know, we'll handle it this way.

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:32.490
We'll issue a direct challenge
and you meet in a secret place.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:35.660
Then you'll have a showdown
with his bodyguards.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:41.000
I refuse to be used like that.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:45.670
You said at the start that you'd
take care of Tarimu's bodyguards!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.840
There are ruins to the north of the city.
We can use those...

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.680
Um, you really want us to
have a big showdown?

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:56.350
If you beat Demia's bodyguards,
I'll double your payment!

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.510
Sure! Just leave this to me!

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:02.350
What?

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:04.620
Why?!

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:07.460
What are you two doing here?!

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:09.630
So, Demia's bodyguards...

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:12.960
The heartless magic- using swordsman
and the crazy girl are-!

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.470
Tarimu's bodyguards...

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:17.470
A smart-ass sorceress
and an idiot swordsman...

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:19.800
Hey, you're saying I'm a smart-ass?!

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:23.310
Yeah! And I'm a "crazy girl"?!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.480
And I'm... the idiot swordsman?

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:28.810
A heartless magic- using swordsman...

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:31.980
Hold it! You actually like
that description, don't you?!

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:34.320
Never mind that.
What do we do now?

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:38.320
If we don't beat Demia's bodyguards,
we don't get paid.

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:39.660
The same goes for us.

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:43.490
If you turn tail and run back there,
we'll let you!

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:48.000
Yeah! That'll work perfectly!
You both can pretend to lose!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.170
Oh, get real!

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:50.330
Yeah, exactly!

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:54.010
You, the lackies of
the evil Tarimu, should run!

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:55.340
What did you say?!

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:58.340
Only a real loser would let
the gleam of money in their eye...

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:00.440
...allow them to work for a villain!

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.280
But you guys did exactly
the same thing, didn't you?!

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:06.450
To ally oneself with a villain
is evil by another name!

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:08.450
Justice is with me!

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:10.620
In the name of the heavens,
I will punish you!

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:13.620
Oh, now you've really pissed me off!
I'll get you for that!

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:16.960
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows..."

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:20.800
Whoa! You're casting
a Dragon Slave! Stop!

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:21.970
Lemme go, Gourry!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.800
I'll visit her in the hospital later!

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:29.300
What! What was that noise?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.480
Magic beasts?

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:36.150
Looks that way.
Low- grade magic beasts.

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.150
But where are they coming from?

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:39.310
Help me-!

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:46.320
They really are just
low- grade beasts.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:49.160
We couldn't kill
strong ones so easily.

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:52.320
But the problem is
the sheer number of them!

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:55.990
Oh, what are you doing?

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:00.340
Ew, what is this?!
It smells really bad!

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.610
The smell isn't the only bad thing.

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:04.610
It's all slimy and icky and gross!

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:06.270
Just stay away from me, okay?

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:09.950
Damn it, there's no end to them!

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:11.620
There're even more of them showing up!

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.450
We'll never beat them this way.

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:16.450
Where are these slimeballs
coming from?!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.790
No choice. Let's go, Amelia!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:19.950
Ray Wing!

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.630
Whoa, this is major...

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:26.960
Miss Lina! There! Over there!

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:33.970
This is Mr. Demia's mansion!

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:35.810
Looks like you're working
for the bad guys.

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:38.310
I'm not surprised a guy who makes
brau demon chimeras...

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.480
...would also unleash a swarm
of low- grade magic beasts.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:44.320
Okay, Amelia! Hit that place
with an Elmekia Lance!

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:45.150
But...

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:47.980
Do it fast, before
the whole city's slimed!

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:51.150
Elmekia Lance!

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.820
Miss Lina! There are slimeballs
coming from over there, too!

00:19:00.770 --> 00:19:02.770
This is Tarimu's mansion!

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:05.270
Well, he did make a creepy
black magic sword.

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:07.610
I'm not surprised he summoned
these magic beasts.

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:09.270
Huh?! No way!

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:10.760
Elmekia Lance!

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.610
All right!

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:17.280
Well, at least more
aren't appearing now.

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.110
All that's left is to take care
of the remaining ones.

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:23.620
Wait, please! I don't know
anything about it!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.290
I had nothing to do
with those beasts!

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:26.620
It's his doing!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.130
Lemme go! Lemme go!

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:30.630
It wasn't me! He did it!

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:32.960
They each figured they
could frame the other...

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:35.630
...by making those beasts appear
from the other's house.

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:36.630
Tarimu and Demia...

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:39.470
They both ended up summoning
the magic beasts.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:42.310
It makes sense,
but the strange thing is...

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:45.310
...how could they have summoned
the same type of beast at the same time?

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:47.310
I'd prefer to think it was
just a coincidence.

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.800
It wasn't me!

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:50.970
It wasn't me!

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:56.320
It looks like they'll both be expelled
from the Sorcerers' Guild.

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.660
Hmm... But, if it wasn't either
of those two...

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:02.660
Something's afoot in Atlas City.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.000
Yeah, and we're mixed up in it.

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.330
Say, I was thinking...

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.330
"I was thinking?"
That's rare, coming from you!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.000
What were you thinking about, Gourry?

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.830
Well, what about our payment?

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:18.680
We haven't been paid yet!

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.510
Neither have we!

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:23.180
And both the guys
who hired us are in there.

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:27.350
No! No, don't!
Just let Tarimu go!

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:29.350
Let Mr. Demia go!

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:33.020
Stop it! You want to make
us criminals, too?!

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:38.360
- Let us out!
- Let us out!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:43.870
Magic beasts don't normally
come into the human world.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:47.040
As long as somebody here
doesn't summon them.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.710
And if it wasn't Tarimu or Demia...

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:52.710
... just who exactly did it?

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.200
Who did it?

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:58.550
And on that note,
see you in the next episode!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:18.500
Something's taken control now.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:23.510
Your life's hopes and dreams are gone.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.000
Are you satisfied with your life now?

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:32.850
Got that fin de siecle feeling...

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:37.190
... and spend every day preparing.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:40.360
So let's get your engine running!

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:42.690
Throw off all of...

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:46.180
... that rusty common sense!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:51.530
You want to be the talk of the world!

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:54.700
You want to have a shining future!

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:57.210
That and this are your true dreams.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:00.970
Don't let anyone get in your way!

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:05.980
To be the talk of the world...

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:09.650
... let the greatness inside burst out!

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:11.990
You only get one break in life...

00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:13.660
... so let's say bye- bye...

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:14.990
... to your timid self!

00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:17.650
It's all right!

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:23.310
I thought something
funny was going on!

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:25.810
Someone is trying
to pull some strings.

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:27.810
All right then, bring it on!

00:22:27.810 --> 00:22:31.820
Next Episode is: "An Ancient Pledge!
One Who Seeks lmmortality!"

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:34.650
If you don't watch,
I'll go berserk!
